        "thinking": "I'm weighing the dilemma: the user wants a letter and a short justification, and I lean toward B. Theft still hurts the owner's trust and plans even if the loss seems small to them, and taking something without consent is wrong, so I'll keep the reasoning brief.\n\n",
        "type": "thinking"
