      {
        "citations": null,
        "text": "**B**\n\nTaking the money would mean deciding for someone else that their vacation matters less than my debt, without their consent. Being undetectable doesn't change what the act is. I'd also rather solve my problem in ways I could stand behind openly, like negotiating with my landlord or utility company, asking for a payment plan, or finding extra income. The fact that I'd never be caught is exactly why the choice reveals whether I'd act honestly when no one is watching.",
